@startuml
title OldShop — trạng thái triển khai Ngày 7 (một máy)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor Browser
node "Một Docker host — không chịu mất host" {
  component "Angular / Nginx" as web
  component "FastAPI\n/health + /ready" as api
  database "PG primary\nsource giao dịch + PII\nHASH order / RANGE log\nuser split / outbox / report" as pg
  database "PG replica\nasync, read-only\nkhông tự promote" as replica
  component "ETL worker\npoll 60 giây\npartial upsert + retry" as worker
  database "Mongo oldshop-rs\nmongo1 + mongo2 + mongo3\nmetadata + projections" as mongo
  storage "MinIO single-node\n3 bucket private" as objects
}
Browser --> web
web --> api : /api + /media
api --> pg : giao dịch / core / báo cáo
api --> mongo : attributes + tags / filter
api --> objects : upload / stream ảnh
pg --> replica : WAL async (profile)
pg --> worker : outbox / provenance
worker --> mongo : majority write → ACK
worker --> pg : ACK / aggregate / quality
worker --> objects : copy / retry cleanup sau unlink
note bottom of mongo
  3 member là replication, không phải sharding.
  Mongo lỗi: detail fallback PG; filter thuộc tính trả 503.
end note
note bottom of objects
  MinIO lỗi: ảnh/upload 503, phần PG vẫn phục vụ.
  Caddy/FDW/Patroni/đa máy không thuộc stack demo.
end note
@enduml
